      "title": "The Archivist’s Cipher",
      "topics": [],
      "fastest": true,
      "reverse": false,
      "shortest": false,
      "solution": "n = int(input())\nresult = 0\n\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    x = int(input())\n    result += x * i if i % 2 == 0 else -x * i\n\n    if result < 0:\n        result = int(str(-result)[::-1]) * -1\n    elif result > 0 and result % 3 == 0:\n        result //= 3\n\nprint(result)",
      "statement": "Decode the Archivist's message by applying the cipher rules to the given sequence of integers.",
